{"productId": "23e7c3e9-e9fc-4eff-b4be-37fa743a90df", "modelName": "110 RF Elite Precision", "modelDescription": "The all-new 110 RF Elite Precision brings the 22LR into a full-size platform. Built on the proven 110 action, this new model is designed to perform. Like its big brother, all 110 RF models will be capable of using stocks or accessories intended for a Savage 110 short-action rifle. The bolt has been designed with the same headspace control that the 110 is known for. The unique front baffle allows the user to interchange the length of bolt throw. It can be configured for a standard 308 Win length throw or shortened to the 22LR length throw. This enables the user to cycle the bolt faster with the 22LR length throw or use it to train with the full-length bolt throw just like a 308 Win. Changing the length of the bolt throw can be completed in under 30 seconds and can be swapped at any time. Feeding from an L3i 10-round AICS-style magazine, the 110 RF\u2019s match-grade chamber will ensure optimum accuracy shot after shot.", "manufacturerName": "Savage", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "f02c4aa3-68de-4402-9a07-ee06fdd0ef4f", "description": "Savage Arms, 110 RF Elite Precision, Bolt Action, 22 Long Rifle, 20\" Threaded Barrel, Dark Gray Finish, MDT ACC Premier Chassis, Right Hand, 10 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/20f9efbc-032e-4c7f-a1fd-d162924799c6", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/269b504a-98a4-4154-b784-ee73467bd676"], "isDefault": true, "manufacturerPartNumber": "33071", "upc": "011356330710", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "3e105ade-7201-49e3-9232-4b92273d4c5c", "attributeName": "Free Floating Barrel", "attributeValueId": "cb319979-7285-4ff4-afed-4926a735631d", "valueName": "Yes"}, {"attributeNameId": "c8cd558c-27d3-4d9a-9936-eb7c87c5ba92", "attributeName": "Color", "attributeValueId": "686f9ab6-d4da-4b52-9040-11b4d447c4e7", "valueName": "Gray"},